{"ticker":"ADP","updated":"2026-10-23T22:33:53Z","profile":{"longName":"Automatic Data Processing, Inc.","shortName":"Automatic Data Processing, Inc.","sector":"Technology","industry":"Software - Application","country":"United States","website":"https://www.adp.com","fullTimeEmployees":67000,"marketCap":120523874304,"trailingPE":27.80256,"forwardPE":22.691734,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":5.4914875,"pegRatio":2.45,"targetMeanPrice":289.06668,"targetHighPrice":340.0,"targetLowPrice":225.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":15,"recommendationKey":"hold","revenueGrowth":0.068,"earningsGrowth":0.098,"grossMargins":0.48653,"operatingMargins":0.23459,"profitMargins":0.20109,"totalRevenue":21947400192,"beta":0.841,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":309.4,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":188.16,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":2.21},"summary":"Automatic Data Processing, Inc. provides cloud-based human capital management (HCM) solutions worldwide. It operates in two segments, Employer Services and Professional Employer Organization (PEO). The Employer Services segment offers strategic, cloud-based platforms, and human resources (HR) outsourcing solutions. This segment's offerings include RUN Powered by ADP, a software platform for small business payroll, HR, and compliance; ADP Workforce Now, a HCM solution used across mid-sized and large businesses to manage employees; and ADP Lyric HCM, a solution for HR management, payroll, workforce management, talent, and data analytics. Its PEO Services segment provides HR outsourcing solutions under ADP TotalSource name to businesses through a co-employment model. This segment also provides guidance, user-friendly technology, comprehensive employee benefits, and a risk management, safety, and workers' compensation program. The company was founded in 1949 and is headquartered in Roseland, New Jersey.","summary_zh":"自動資料處理公司在全球範圍內提供基於雲端的人力資本管理 (HCM) 解決方案。它分為兩個部門：雇主服務部門和專業雇主組織（PEO）部門。雇主服務部門提供基於雲端的策略平台和人力資源 (HR) 外包解決方案。該部門的產品包括 RUN Powered by ADP，這是一個針對小型企業薪資、人力資源和合規性的軟體平台； ADP Workforce Now，一個跨大中型企業用於管理員工的 HCM 解決方案；以及 ADP Lyric HCM，這是一個針對人力資源管理、薪資、勞動力管理、人才和資料分析的解決方案。其 PEO 服務部門以 ADP TotalSource 名義透過共同僱用模式向企業提供人力資源外包解決方案。該部門還提供指導、用戶友好的技術、全面的員工福利以及風險管理、安全和工人補償計劃。該公司成立於 1949 年，總部位於新澤西州羅斯蘭。","sector_zh":"科技","industry_zh":"軟體 - 應用程式","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":306.71,"h":307.8,"l":303.28,"c":303.84,"v":1138000},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":303.13,"h":304.67,"l":302.12,"c":303.45,"v":2503400},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":302.53,"h":304.33,"l":301.96,"c":303.09,"v":1109600},{"t":"2025-08-28","o":303.04,"h":304.45,"l":301.75,"c":304.1,"v":1488200},{"t":"2025-08-29","o":302.65,"h":305.31,"l":302.65,"c":304.05,"v":1106900},{"t":"2025-09-02","o":301.64,"h":302.45,"l":298.3,"c":299.77,"v":1648300},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":296.57,"h":300.07,"l":294.59,"c":298.86,"v":1447900},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":298.92,"h":301.58,"l":296.71,"c":301.19,"v":1735400},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":301.19,"h":302.68,"l":293.95,"c":295.97,"v":1892500},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":296.58,"h":298.59,"l":293.51,"c":298.43,"v":1716600},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":298.43,"h":298.9,"l":296.22,"c":297.24,"v":1349900},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":297.84,"h":297.84,"l":290.38,"c":292.39,"v":1762100},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":291.96,"h":299.22,"l":291.96,"c":298.03,"v":1984800},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":294.96,"h":296.86,"l":292.19,"c":293.5,"v":1100100},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":293.57,"h":294.93,"l":290.2,"c":290.87,"v":1290500},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":290.25,"h":291.91,"l":282.27,"c":288.69,"v":2609100},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":289.13,"h":291.32,"l":287.74,"c":288.75,"v":2275800},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":288.06,"h":292.3,"l":287.44,"c":290.95,"v":2184400},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":293.51,"h":293.51,"l":290.7,"c":292.0,"v":4039600},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":289.46,"h":294.46,"l":288.54,"c":293.66,"v":2179600},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":292.21,"h":293.49,"l":287.31,"c":289.21,"v":1926200},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":288.6,"h":292.87,"l":287.94,"c":291.5,"v":3456600},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":291.9,"h":293.29,"l":287.66,"c"