https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-10-22","zh":"深入分析：自動數據處理與專業服務業的競爭對手"}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":4},{"name":"雲端/軟體","count":1},{"name":"分析師評等","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-08-05","period":"2026-06-30","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/8670/000000867026000030/adp-20260630.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"In 1949, our founders established ADP with a simple, innovative idea: help clients focus on their business by solving their payroll challenges. In the 77 years since, we have led the Human Capital Management (\"HCM\") industry in innovation. We were the first in HCM to deliver automation, move to the cloud, provide a mobile app, and create an online marketplace. Today, we continue that legacy with artificial intelligence (\"AI\"), building AI into the very core of how we orchestrate, govern and execute HR and pay processes for real-world outcomes.","zh":"1949 年，我們的創辦人懷著一個簡單而創新的理念創立了 ADP：透過解決薪資挑戰來幫助客戶專注於他們的業務。 77 年來，我們一直引領人力資本管理（「HCM」）產業的創新。我們是 HCM 領域第一家提供自動化、遷移到雲端、提供行動應用程式並創建線上市場的公司。今天，我們透過人工智慧（「AI」）延續這項傳統，將人工智慧建構成我們如何協調、管理和執行人力資源和薪酬流程以實現現實世界成果的核心。"},{"en":"As AI adds new layers of complexity to managing the workforce infrastructure that makes business possible, our clients need a partner they can trust. As the trusted, service-driven, and AI-enabled partner for HCM, we deliver services powered by deep domain expertise, workforce data, and global scale to help organizations manage their most critical workforce functions with precision, compliance and confidence. Today, we are a global leader in HR and payroll solutions, serving over 1.1 million clients and paying over 42 million workers in over 140 countries and territories. Our common stock is listed on the NASDAQ Global Select Market under the symbol \"ADP.\"","zh":"隨著人工智慧為管理使業務成為可能的勞動力基礎設施增加了新的複雜性，我們的客戶需要一個他們可以信任的合作夥伴。作為 HCM 值得信賴的、服務驅動型和人工智慧支援的合作夥伴，我們提供由深厚的領域專業知識、勞動力數據和全球規模支援的服務，幫助組織精確、合規和自信地管理其最關鍵的勞動力職能。如今，我們是人力資源和薪資解決方案領域的全球領導者，為 140 多個國家和地區的超過 110 萬名客戶提供服務，並為超過 4,200 萬名員工支付薪資。我們的普通股在納斯達克全球精選市場上市，代號為「ADP」。"},{"en":"When we refer to \"we,\" \"us,\" \"our,\" \"ADP,\" or the \"Company\" in this Annual Report on Form 10-K, we mean Automatic Data Processing, Inc. and its consolidated subsidiaries.","zh":"當我們在 10-K 表格年度報告中提及「我們」、「我們的」、「ADP」或「本公司」時，我們指的是 Automatic Data Processing, Inc. 及其合併子公司。"}],"markets":[{"en":"To help clients manage the workforce infrastructure that makes business possible, whether they're a Fortune 500 company or a small local business, we provide a unified ecosystem of HCM solutions rooted in our industry-leading data and deep domain expertise. Our strategic cloud-based platforms, scalable by company size and location, allow clients to recruit, onboard, pay, manage and retain their people in one single space with precision, compliance and confidence. Our AI is built into the very core of how our platforms orchestrate, govern and execute HR and pay processes for real-world outcomes.","zh":"為了幫助客戶管理使業務成為可能的勞動力基礎設施，無論他們是財富 500 強公司還是小型本地企業，我們提供了一個統一的 HCM 解決方案生態系統，這些解決方案植根於我們行業領先的數據和深厚的領域專業知識。我們基於雲端的策略平台可根據公司規模和地點進行擴展，使客戶能夠在一個空間中準確、合規且充滿信心地招募、入職、支付、管理和留住員工。我們的人工智慧已成為我們平台如何協調、管理和執行人力資源和薪酬流程以實現現實結果的核心。"},{"en":"Integrated HCM Solutions. Our premier suite of HCM solutions support employers of all types and sizes across the entire employment cycle, from recruitment to retirement.","zh":"整合 HCM 解決方案。我們一流的 HCM 解決方案套件在從招聘到退休的整個就業週期中為各種類型和規模的雇主提供支援。"}],"customers":[],"competition":[{"en":"The industries in which we operate are highly competitive and we are one of the largest providers of HCM solutions in the world. HCM Solutions, Global Solutions and HRO Solutions (other than PEO) compete with other business outsourcing companies, companies providing ERP services, providers of cloud-based HCM solutions and financial institutions. Our PEO business competes with other PEOs providing similar services, as well as business outsourcing companies, companies providing ERP services and providers of cloud-based HCM solutions. We also face ongoing competition from companies' in-house functions, whereby companies install and operate their own HCM system.","zh":"我們所在的產業競爭激烈，我們是全球最大的 HCM 解決方案供應商之一。 HCM Solutions、Global Solutions 和 HRO Solutions（PEO 除外）與其他業務外包公司、提供 ERP 服務的公司、基於雲端的 HCM 解決方案供應商和金融機構競爭。我們的 PEO 業務與提供類似服務的其他 PEO、以及業務外包公司、提供 ERP 服務的公司和基於雲端的 HCM 解決方案供應商競爭。我們也面臨來自公司內部職能部門的持續競爭，公司內部職能部門負責安裝和營運自己的 HCM 系統。"},{"en":"Competition for business outsourcing solutions is primarily based on product and service quality, reputation, ease of use and accessibility of technology, breadth of offerings, and price. We believe that we are competitive in each of these areas and that our leading-edge technology (together with our data) and commitment to service excellence, distinguishes us from our competitors.","zh":"業務外包解決方案的競爭主要基於產品和服務品質、聲譽、技術的易用性和可及性、產品的廣度和價格。我們相信，我們在這些領域都具有競爭力，我們的領先技術（連同我們的數據）和對卓越服務的承諾使我們有別於競爭對手。"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2026-06-30","items":[{"name":"Employer Services","val":14831400000,"zh":"雇主服務部門"},{"name":"Professional Employee Organization Services","val":7128100000,"zh":"專業員工組織服務部門"}],"total":21947400000},"prod":{"end":"2026-06-30","items":[{"name":"Revenues Other Than Interest On Funds Held For Client","val":20592600000,"zh":"為客戶所持有的資金利息以外的收入"},{"name":"Revenues Other Than Interest On Funds Held For Clients & PEO Revenues","val":13476800000,"zh":"為客戶持有的資金利息以外的收入和 PEO 收入"},{"name":"HCM","val":9120400000,"zh":"肥厚型心肌病變"},{"name":"PEO Revenues","val":7115800000,"zh":"PEO Revenues"},{"name":"PEO Zero Margin Benefits Pass Throughs","val":4607300000,"zh":"PEO 零利潤福利傳遞"},{"name":"HRO","val":3975800000,"zh":"人力資源管理辦公室"},{"name":"Global","val":2901200000,"zh":"全球的"},{"name":"Interest On Funds Held For Clients","val":1354800000,"zh":"為客戶持有的資金利息"}],"total":21947400000},"geo":{"end":"2026-06-30","items":[{"name":"US","val":19279800000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"EMEA","val":1733300000,"zh":"歐洲、中東和非洲地區"},{"name":"CA","val":523700000.00000006,"zh":"加拿大"},{"name":"Other Geographical Places","val":410600000,"zh":"Other Geographical Places"}],"total":21947400000}},"peers":["PAYX","ITW","APD","EMR","AFL"]}}